<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Shared Medical.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Shared Medical.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Shared Medical Systems Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>And it said it was keeping its long-term accumulate rating on the company.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shared Medical fell 1/8 to 53-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
